WEBVTT

00:02:57.955 --> 00:03:01.582
Marafiki zangu walisema vichekesho,
lakini sikuweza kuwaelewa.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.976
Mashujaa wangu walikuwa George Carlin
na Stephen Colbert --

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.381
na walinifundisha ucheshi.

00:03:10.881 --> 00:03:14.687
Haiba yangu ikabadilika
kutoka kuwa na aibu na wa ajabu

00:03:14.711 --> 00:03:17.504
kuwa mtukutu na ninayesababisha dhoruba

00:03:18.322 --> 00:03:21.055
Sina haja ya kusema,
Sikuwa na marafiki wengi.

00:03:21.714 --> 00:03:23.992
Lakini pia nilikuwa na hisia kali na 
hali za vitu.

00:03:24.722 --> 00:03:28.409
Hisia ya maji kwenye ngozi yangu
ilikuwa kama sindano na pini,

00:03:28.433 --> 00:03:30.727
hivyo kwa miaka mingi, nilikataa kuoga.